  {
    "id": "rules",
    "face": "corner",
    "dur": 18.85,
    "talk": 18.85,
    "media": "pitch-vo/rules.mp3",
    "video": false,
    "trim": 0,
    "segments": null,
    "lead": 0.12,
    "lines": [
      {
        "t": "Here's how a raid plays.",
        "start": 0.12,
        "end": 0.92
      },
      {
        "t": "A sponsor puts up a wall and a prize.",
        "start": 0.98,
        "end": 2.72
      },
      {
        "t": "For about a minute, every seat taps HIT. Each hit buys from the wall.",
        "start": 2.78,
        "end": 5.78
      },
      {
        "t": "The last stretch is the danger zone: the raid can end on any block in there.",
        "start": 5.84,
        "end": 9.37
      },
      {
        "t": "Pyth draws the end block. Hits before it count. Hits after it don't.",
        "start": 9.43,
        "end": 13.02
      },
      {
        "t": "Hit the target, the wall breaks and the seats split the prize.",
        "start": 13.08,
        "end": 15.91
      },
      {
        "t": "Miss it, and the prize rolls into the sponsor's next raid.",
        "start": 15.97,
        "end": 18.55
      }
    ],
    "cues": [
      0.12,
      0.98,
      2.78,
      5.84,
      9.43,
      13.08,
      15.97
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "how",
    "face": "corner",
    "dur": 24.65,
    "talk": 24.65,
    "media": "pitch-vo/how.mp3",
    "video": false,
    "trim": 0,
    "segments": null,
    "lead": 0.12,
    "lines": [
      {
        "t": "Under the hood, every hit is a buy on Kuru's order book on Monad, capped at the wall price.",
        "start": 0.12,
        "end": 4.54
      },
      {
        "t": "Cheaper asks fill first, and anything left over is cancelled and refunded in the same transaction.",
        "start": 4.6,
        "end": 9.36
      },
      {
        "t": "The end of the raid is drawn by Pyth Entropy after the window closes, so nobody can snipe the last block.",
        "start": 9.42,
        "end": 14.73
      },
      {
        "t": "And only seats count.",
        "start": 14.79,
        "end": 15.66
      },
      {
        "t": "A wallet without a Lil Star can still buy, but it earns nothing.",
        "start": 15.72,
        "end": 18.34
      },
      {
        "t": "On testnet, raid #26 broke its wall: 58 hits, 580 counted against a 500 target.",
        "start": 18.4,
        "end": 24.35
      }
    ],
    "cues": [
      0.12,
      4.6,
      9.42,
      14.79,
